mapping "V4558.1" source="V4558" target="36198007" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V4558 = Swedish 5-char extension of ICD10 V45.5 SNOMED CT 242090001 36198007. Parent V45.5
        (Athena 45585433) has crosswalk to SNOMED CT 444074 (Victim of vehicular AND/OR traffic accident)
